;; spec:   stdlib §4.4 (row cycle: an infinite source), §2.7 (three printers), §14 D7 of the tranche 2 plan (no ToStr for an endless source)
;; expect: reject
;; error:  no implementation of ToStr for (Cycle
;; roots:  ../../lib support
;; covers: str
;; The same refusal for `Cycle` and `ToStr`, the protocol of `str`: `(str (cycle [1 2]))` has no instance, since
;; `ToStr` of a collection is its Debug text and the text of a cycle does not end. D7 is **Proposed
;; (plan recommendation, owner not yet confirmed)**. The three protocols and three types of the
;; endless sources have each one case (2963 Show of an `Iterate`, 2964 Debug of a `Repeat`, this one).
(ns main)

(defun main () -> i64 (str-len (str (cycle [1 2]))))
